#, fuzzy
msgid "1. What EcoBank is"
msgstr "Acerca de Ecobank"

#: app/templates/main/terms.html:11
msgid ""
"EcoBank is a tool for taking part in communities on the Hive blockchain — "
"mainly by publishing content through an account a group shares. It is not a "
"bank, a financial service, a custodian of money, an exchange, or an "
"investment product. See the"
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/main/terms.html:12
msgid "for how keys are handled."
